<title>SINGAPORE: BADMINTON-SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth round results from the</p>
<p>Konica Cup Singapore International Badminton Championships on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Sun Jun (China) beat Rosobin Jeffer (Indonesia) 14-17 15-3 15-4</p>
<p>Marleve Mainaky (Indonesia) beat Fung Permadi (Taiwan) 15-11</p>
<p>15-8</p>
<p>George Rimarodi (Indonesia) beat Henrik Bengtsson (Sweden) 15-4</p>
<p>15-6</p>
<p>Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) beat Ji Xinpeng (China) 15-6 15-10</p>
<p>Ardy Wiranata (Indonesia) beat Jeroen van Dijk (Netherlands)</p>
<p>15-6 18-17</p>
<p>Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) beat H.Hendrawan (Indonesia) 15-1 15-8</p>
<p>Jason Wong (Malaysia) beat Chen Gang (China) 10-15 15-10 15-8</p>
<p>Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat Wong Choong Hann (Malaysia) 15-5</p>
<p>15-7</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Gong Zhixhai (China) beat Hiriko Nagamine (Japan) 11-3 11-5</p>
<p>Yu Hua (China) beat Lee Kyung-won (South Korea)  11-0 8-11 11-4</p>
<p>Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) beat Gong Ruina (China) 11-7 11-2</p>
<p>Judith Meulendijks (Netherlands) beat Ellen Engelina</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 11-4 9-12 11-3</p>
<p>Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea) beat Brenda Beenhakker (Netherlands)</p>
<p>11-3 12-10</p>
<p>Zhang Ning (China) beat Lidya Djaelawaidjaya (Indonesia) 11-5</p>
<p>5-11</p>
<p>11-2</p>
<p>Pornsawan Plungwech (Thailand) beat Ishwari Boopathy (Malaysia)</p>
<p>11-1 11-4</p>
<p>Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Zhou Mi (China) 11-4 11-8</p>
</text>
